{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ars Vox Arcana</strong> is a voice-driven fantasy <strong>duel-game</strong> where you command magic through spoken incantations. <br>Whether in full VR or with PC and mouse and keyboard, you take the role of a wizard whose words shape reality. This is more than spellcasting. This is language-born sorcery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description0.png?t=1744359159\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Engage in magical duels with your friends, where strategy and spellcasting skill determine the victor.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description1.png?t=1744359159\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Say the words, shape the world. Build incantations in real time using modular arcane phrases. Each word changes the result\u2014no menus, just magic.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description2.png?t=1744359159\" />Ars Vox Arcana is built for VR immersion, but fully supports traditional PC play.<br>Both modes offer the same depth, spellcraft, and progression.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description3.png?t=1744359159\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Combine hidden forms, elements, and whispers of power. Discover new interactions, refine your ritual voice, and experiment with arcane structures.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description5.png?t=1744359159\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Everything is processed locally for seamless and private spellcasting. No cloud, no delays\u2014your voice acts instantly.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3242830/extras/Description6.png?t=1744359159\" /></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Unlock deeper layers of language. Find fragments of forgotten speech, each a piece of a greater magical truth.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Obscura","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/83a6e65d610b004c52cbf4698b08ac59b9e4ce17.jpg"},{"name":"Alta","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/2e1b26f6f5718a7eb5258866e308043b1ed67ad2.jpg"},{"name":"Bastion","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/bc9427211fdb64fbdef3add876e2f7a492854f49.jpg"},{"name":"Unda","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/d3c893bb0b732038de4a8a85f5648127ce11816a.jpg"},{"name":"Solar","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/42cdc18f0e5384c0487401714f7ea5f1400d6ad9.jpg"},{"name":"Bruma","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/e3c4ebc8d7e0af39f50dd026856941af9ca5774f.jpg"},{"name":"Zawra","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/9e864eb84a92168f1ab6f61fc696a769585843ce.jpg"},{"name":"Fumana","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/dad4d99c33ecbe818803d67da2ec1524c0232fcb.jpg"},{"name":"Win a duel","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830/05ff76e50e2d85e7a5a70c252a5367c1679a3bcd.jpg"},{"name":"Complete campaign","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3242830